</span>
</span></span></p>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5: </span><span id="A2.F5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">The summation of attention scores in the 2nd and 3rd layers.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A2.F6" class="ltx_figure">
