<p id="A5.SS3.p1.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p1.12.1" class="ltx_text">The second step of (<a href="#A5.E142" title="In Proof. ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix E Proof of Supportive Lemmas ‣ Can Mamba Learn In Context with Outliers? A Theoretical Generalization Analysis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">142</span></a>) comes from the fact that</span></p>
