</table>
<p id="A5.SS5.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS5.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text">which is a rotation of in-context examples for <math id="A5.SS5.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in[l]\cup\{0\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in[l]\cup\{0\}</annotation></semantics></math>. Therefore, we have</span></p>
